37
00:03:08.898 --> 00:03:13.277
I'm Doctor James Peterson.
Head of the Osiris Project.

38
00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:17.197
Tonight. my friends. we stand
at the gateway to a new age.

39
00:03:17.281 --> 00:03:19.867
