may be resurrected.

40
00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:22.453
And their lives extended by decades.

41
00:03:22.536 --> 00:03:27.708
And we thank Mr. Corrigan for volunteering
to be our first test subject.

42
00:03:27.791 --> 00:03:31.211
For volunteering
to have his sentence reduced.

43
00:03:32.838 --> 00:03:36.133
First. we must stop
the test subject's heart.

44
00:05:44.928 --> 00:05:46.513
