I've got a wife and kids!

55
00:06:58.627 --> 00:07:00.754
Not such a tough guy anymore. huh?

56
00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:50.512
Hell of a way to die...
and it's almost Christmas.

57
00:07:50.596 --> 00:07:53.056
Hate to feel sorry for a guy
like Corrigan. but...

58
00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:56.393
