to go out like that.

59
00:07:58.270 --> 00:08:00.272
So what are you doin'
for New Year's?

60
00:08:00.355 --> 00:08:02.482
Anything like last New Year's.

61
00:08:02.566 --> 00:08:05.319
I'll be trying to walk off
a wicked hangover from...

62
00:08:14.036 --> 00:08:16.914
Perhaps it's a blessing
the experiment failed.

63
00:08:16.997 --> 00:08:20.500
