Ooh. Excuse the jolt. sir.

72
00:08:51.281 --> 00:08:53.283
It appears there's been an accident.

73
00:09:17.266 --> 00:09:19.810
You shouldn't have been there
in the first place.

74
00:09:19.893 --> 00:09:21.728
I had to face him. Dad.

75
00:09:21.812 --> 00:09:25.023
- You could've been killed.
- But I wasn't. was I?

76
00:09:25.107 --> 00:09:28.694
I've. uh... got some paperwork
to take care of.

77
00:09:28.777 --> 00:09:30.070
You do that.

78
00:09:30.779 --> 00:09:33.532
Thank you. Renee.

79
00:09:36.535 --> 00:09:38.036
I'm okay. Dad.

80
00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.371
But...

81
00:09:39.454 --> 00:09:41.248
