86
00:09:52.301 --> 00:09:55.595
It says you've been through
something traumatic. sweetheart.

87
00:09:56.638 --> 00:09:58.140
It says you're human.

88
00:09:59.057 --> 00:10:01.560
Why doesn't that make me feel any better?

89
00:10:02.394 --> 00:10:04.146
I'm gonna head home. Coming?

90
00:10:04.229 --> 00:10:07.566
I'd love to. but I've still got work
to finish up.

91
00:10:08.442 --> 00:10:11.278
Be careful out there. Barb.
Storm's getting rough.

92
00:10:11.945 --> 00:10:14.281
Oh please. I'm a better driver
