109
00:11:54.798 --> 00:11:58.552
Left with two bullets in him.
But I gotta tell ya...

110
00:11:58.635 --> 00:12:01.054
I can understand
why Vinny croaked like that.

111
00:12:01.138 --> 00:12:04.307
That Corrigan guy...
He didn't seem human.

112
00:12:06.685 --> 00:12:10.564
Good evening. This is
Houseman Welch welcoming you

113
