133
00:14:29.869 --> 00:14:36.293
That wasn't on me! She was my wife!
She fell down those stairs! The jury said!

134
00:14:36.376 --> 00:14:37.544
Come on. brother.

135
00:14:37.627 --> 00:14:40.171
You're not gonna ice me
over one worthless piece...

136
