138
00:15:24.424 --> 00:15:27.510
I swear Christmas Eve's
just like a full moon in this town.

139
00:15:27.594 --> 00:15:29.596
All the loonies come out.

140
00:15:29.679 --> 00:15:30.972
Should I wait up?

141
00:15:31.056 --> 00:15:33.767
You don't have to sweetheart.
I'll see you in the morning.

142
00:15:35.352 --> 00:15:39.814
- Are you okay? You sound...
- No. no. I'm fine.

143
00:15:39.898 --> 00:15:40.898
It's just...

144
00:15:41.441 --> 00:15:43.735
I can't get Corrigan out of my head.

145
00:15:43.818 --> 00:15:46.738
The sound of him screaming.
his body writhing in pain. I...

146
00:15:46.821 --> 00:15:50.950
Forget Corrigan.
He did what he did and paid for it.

147
00:15:51.826 --> 00:15:54.913
You are here. Alive and well.

148
00:15:55.789 --> 00:15:56.790
Justice.

149
00:15:57.957 --> 00:15:59.542
