been spotted again.

155
00:16:21.815 --> 00:16:24.150
Sixth and 51st near Wycliffe Center.

156
00:16:26.319 --> 00:16:28.446
"Then he heard the noise much louder.

157
00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:32.117
on the floors below.
then coming up the stairs.

158
00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:34.869
then coming straight towards his door!

159
00:16:34.953 --> 00:16:37.789
It came on through the heavy door..."

160
00:16:37.872 --> 00:16:39.833
Geez. late again.

161
00:16:39.915 --> 00:16:41.793
Considering what I pay that broad...

162
00:16:41.876 --> 00:16:43.670
You'd think she'd be a...

163
00:16:43.753 --> 00:16:45.672
- "Who are you?"
- Get that.

164
00:16:47.966 --> 00:16:51.720
"'Who were you then?'
said Scrooge. raising his voice."

165
00:16:55.181 --> 00:16:59.269
Freddy... Borke.

166
00:16:59.894 --> 00:17:03.648
Corrigan? But... but word
from my boys is you're dead!

167
00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:18.079
What do you want from me?

168
00:17:18.163 --> 00:17:21.040
Vengeance.

169
00:17:51.613 --> 00:17:53.865
Oh! No!

170
00:17:53.948 --> 00:17:56.409
Not you too!

171
00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:42.622
[shrieks. whimpers

172
00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:13.236
Dad?

173
00:19:13.319 --> 00:19:16.197
Vinny DeLeon. Roger Marshall.
Freddy Borke.

174
00:19:16.281 --> 00:19:17.115
Batman.

175
00:19:17.198 --> 00:19:19.701
I need to know how they're connected
to Jim Corrigan.

176
00:19:19.784 --> 00:19:22.912
- Corrigan? Corrigan's dead.
- I beg to differ.

177
00:19:22.996 --> 00:19:24.163
He's alive?

178
00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:29.961
- Peterson's experiment. It must've...
- What do these three men have in common?

179
00:19:32.297 --> 00:19:33.506
DeLeon. he...

180
00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:36.092
Bilked dozens of people
