181
00:19:36.175 --> 00:19:37.677
Marshall murdered his wife.

182
00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:39.971
Borke had his fingers
deep in the drug trade.

183
00:19:40.054 --> 00:19:42.473
I know all that. What's the connection?

184
00:19:43.892 --> 00:19:46.769
Corrigan was the arresting officer
in all three cases.

185
00:19:46.853 --> 00:19:48.396
And?

186
00:19:49.606 --> 00:19:51.649
