190
00:19:58.239 --> 00:19:59.699
What? No.

191
00:20:00.283 --> 00:20:03.578
There's no reward anymore.
He has no earthly reason to...

192
00:20:03.661 --> 00:20:07.290
We don't know what he's thinking.
Call your father. Get protection.

193
00:20:07.373 --> 00:20:09.459
If he is coming for you. then...

194
00:20:14.213 --> 00:20:15.506
Then I'll be ready.

195
00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:35.526
Corrigan.

196
00:22:09.412 --> 00:22:12.290
Time to end this.
One way or another.

197
00:22:28.181 --> 00:22:31.309
Barbara...

198
00:22:32.185 --> 00:22:34.187
Gordon.

199
00:22:35.313 --> 00:22:37.398
Not another step.

200
00:22:46.741 --> 00:22:49.535
Ready to die again? You son of a bitch.

201
00:22:56.125 --> 00:22:57.668
Barbara.

202
00:23:11.307 --> 00:23:12.934
I never hurt you!

203
00:23:13.017 --> 00:23:15.186
I'm not some criminal who escaped justice!

204
00:23:15.269 --> 00:23:17.980
You tried to kill me. For money!

205
00:23:18.439 --> 00:23:20.566
So why. Jim? Why are you here?

206
00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:23.152
What do you want from me?

207
00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.782
Forgiveness.

208
00:23:38.501 --> 00:23:39.961
Please.

209
00:23:40.837 --> 00:23:42.588
Forgive me.

210
00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:55.560
Barbara!

211
00:24:18.040 --> 00:24:19.083
Dead.

212
00:24:20.418 --> 00:24:21.836
He's dead.

213
00:24:21.919 --> 00:24:23.754
He came all this way and...

214
00:24:24.547 --> 00:24:26.841
He just wanted me to forgive him.

215
00:24:29.135 --> 00:24:30.511
That's all.

216
00:25:01.667 --> 00:25:03.044
You all right?

217
00:25:03.127 --> 00:25:04.462
Honestly?

218
00:25:05.421 --> 00:25:06.422
No.

219
00:25:10.801 --> 00:25:14.347
But... I think I will be.

219
